  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Roast pumpkin and onion: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line 2 large oven trays with baking paper. Peel the pumpkin and cut into 1cm-thick wedges. Thinly slice the onion. Put the pumpkin and onion on a lined tray. Drizzle with 1 tbs olive oil and 2 tsp balsamic vinegar and season with salt and pepper. Roast for 20-25 mins until tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/698437/photos/large/71077_1-e2295d9929a1b9d73638476ac570125c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toast pepitas: Meanwhile, finely grate the parmesan. Put the pepitas in a cold small frypan over medium heat. Toast, tossing, for 3-4 mins until evenly golden. Remove from the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/698438/photos/large/71077_2-35290d4a6207a597499e99e55b33fc84.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Assemble pizzas: Put 2 pitas on the remaining lined tray. Spread with 2 tbs tomato paste. Top with the roasted pumpkin and onion, then scatter over half the parmesan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/698442/photos/large/71077_3-b4d162231b91f800536ce2299fbe6688.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pizzas: Bake the pizzas for 12 mins or until golden and the cheese is melted.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/698444/photos/large/71077_4-a08f82e533236460022138690af20b46.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Scatter the spinach (see Cooking tip), pepitas and remaining parmesan over the pizzas, drizzle with the horseradish dressing and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/698446/photos/large/71077_5-0fe915cffd64bb609a575bf82aafc563.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Horseradish dressing has a peppery, mustardy punch that goes very well with the sweet pumpkin. If you have young ones, drizzle mayonnaise over their portions instead.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/698449/photos/large/71077_6-1045b4f1c73e9703c3b0ec0ca0e51dc8.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
